{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/7738743/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前に撮ったやつだす！いくちゃん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うー体が痛い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「湿布を送ってください」とままに電話しました。貼りたいときにいつでも貼れる体制をとらないと(　・´ｰ・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湿布を背中に貼ったままお風呂はいってしまって、上がってから気がついて剥がしたら、かっっゆい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かゆくてガシガシかいたら、ただれた...！屈辱やわ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湿布あなどれねぇ。(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「16人のプリンシパル」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とうとうあしたは初日です。頭も体もいっぱいいっぱいやけど、ぜったいに驚くステージを作りますえへ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/7738743/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かっこいいちりとり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤングなでしこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回も試合は観れませんでしたが、3-1で勝ったということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やったぁー！おめでとうございます(　・´ｰ・｀)！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家をでるまえのテレビと、帰ってきたときのテレビので活躍を観てます。すぽると！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ暑いですが今日もがんばりましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたしもがんばります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"}